/* ==================== 跑腿行插曲 1–5 与 酒馆后厨插曲 1–5 ==================== */

:: MP Job Courier Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCourierEncounter to 1>>
雨点斜扫过康努达图斯街的檐口，你护在皮袋最里层的一封商行加急信还是洇透了一角，收件人的门环上挂着「外出」的木牌。斜对面钟表铺的学徒芬恩探出头来，说那只精密怀表件必须赶在整点报时钟响前送到，否则整批托运都要退回。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-courier-enc">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<runicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240>><<link "冒雨抄近巷 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 270 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你把邮袋往怀里一扣，踩着湿滑的石板钻进连廊与后巷的捷径，在报时铜钟落槌前把怀表件递到芬恩手里。芬恩验过封蜡，又把那封急信转交给刚从后门回来的收件人，顺手结了一份加急脚力钱。<span class="green">两桩件都在整点前送到了。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 700>><</if>>
	<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_2 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_2 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	巷口一辆运货推车横在雨里，你绕路时靴底一滑，邮袋磕在石阶上。等你赶到钟表铺，整点的钟声已经敲过，芬恩为难地摇了摇头。<span class="red">脚力钱没结，你还得回去重封那封信。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[冒雨抄近巷 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "冒雨抄近巷">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpsneakicon>><<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 220>><<link "翻墙递怀表 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc">>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你攀上钟表铺后院的矮墙，从虚掩的工坊气窗翻进去，把怀表件搁在工作台正中的绒布上，又在签收簿里夹进撕下的回执。修表师推门时正好看见表壳上的封蜡完好，把这份托运费记在你名下。<span class="green">你没惊动前厅的客人就交了件。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 560>><</if>>
	<<skulduggery 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_2 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_2 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	气窗的木插销早已朽死，你扳到一半发出闷响，前厅的铃铛跟着响了起来。修表师提着灯绕到后院，你只好讪讪地把邮袋从墙头递过去。<span class="red">这一趟只换来一句「下次走正门」。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[翻墙递怀表 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "翻墙递怀表">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpclockworkicon>><<if ($mpJobClockLevel or 0) gte 2>><<link "借钟表铺烘蜡 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc">>
你直接推开钟表铺侧门把表件交给芬恩，又借工作台上的烤蓝酒精灯烘干急信边角，用铺子里的火漆铜章补压了封口。外出的收件人恰好在隔壁茶座避雨，芬恩一眼认出对方，帮你当面完成了签收。<span class="green">钟表铺的熟人帮你一举两得地结了急单。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 640>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_2 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_2 or 0) + 1>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">借钟表铺烘蜡 (0:05)（钟表铺还没这份交情）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<link "檐下重封信件 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc">>
你退到钟表铺的檐下，用防雨蜡块把洇湿的封口重新烫严，又把写花的地址一笔笔描清，再将表件交到芬恩手中。<span class="teal">你稳妥保住了信封与表件。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 300>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job Courier Encounter 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCourierEncounter to 1>>
常客药剂师温德尔把一只衬着锡皮的小木匣交到窗口，里面码着六支送往医院药房的低温血清安瓿。午后日头正毒，石板路晒得发烫，匣底的碎冰已经化了一半，稍有颠簸或者受热，整匣药剂就要报废。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-courier-enc2">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpfirstaidicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 240>><<link "穿阴凉水渠巷 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc2">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你用湿毛巾裹住锡皮匣外壁，挑背阴的石拱水渠巷快步穿行，手肘悬空卸去脚下震动。送到医院药房时，匣内碎冰还剩小半，六支安瓿澄澈冰凉，温德尔与药房主管给你记下了双倍专送费。<span class="green">六支血清安瓿在冰点下稳稳送达。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_2_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 740>><</if>>
	<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_1 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_1 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	水渠巷底青苔打滑，你扶墙稳住身形时木匣晃了一下，虽没碎瓶，冰水却漏湿了签收单，药房核验了半晌才收下。<span class="red">捏了一把冷汗，没能拿到加急赏金。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[穿阴凉水渠巷 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "穿阴凉水渠巷">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpfishicon>><<if ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 2>><<link "借鱼档盐冰护匣 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc2">>
你顺路拐到鱼档送货车旁，向老鱼贩讨了两铲加了粗盐的深层碎冰填满锡皮匣夹层。盐冰融得极慢，送到医院时匣壁还结着白霜，温德尔连声称赞你懂冰镇门道。<span class="green">鱼档的盐冰让药匣一路冷透。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_2_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 680>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_1 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_1 or 0) + 1>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">借鱼档盐冰护匣 (0:05)（鱼档还没这份交情）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link "塞棉布稳步送 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc2">>
你往安瓿缝隙里塞满干棉布防撞，挑着街边骑楼阴影一步步稳妥走到医院。冰虽化尽了，药瓶总算完好。<span class="teal">平顺交差，领到了基础专送钱。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_2_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 320>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job Courier Encounter 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCourierEncounter to 1>>
报馆排字工汉克夹着一叠刚印出的晚报清样跑来代办亭，准备加急送往主编宅邸审阅。可交接时一阵穿堂狂风掀开纸夹，十二页未装订的清样散落半空，有几张挂上了街角凉棚顶，其余散在石板路上乱滚。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-courier-enc3">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpclimbicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250>><<link "攀檐抢收原稿 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc3">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 270 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你踩着邮筒底座翻上凉棚木架，赶在阵风再起前一把按住挂在檐角的四张头版清样，落地时顺势用脚尖压住滚向水沟的尾页。十二页清样一张未缺，汉克抹着额头冷汗，把报馆的加急津贴全塞给了你。<span class="green">十二页晚报清样被你原封不动地抢了回来。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_3_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 780>><</if>>
	<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_3 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_3 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	你从凉棚跳下时踩滑了石阶，手里的两页副刊被风撕开一道口子，汉克只得跑回排字房补印。<span class="red">脚踝震得发麻，误了头班急送。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[攀檐抢收原稿 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "攀檐抢收原稿">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpreadicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 220>><<link "按文脉排页码 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc3">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 250 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	清样尚未印上页码，你把拾回的纸页摊在窗口，顺着社论与海港专栏的上下文衔接飞快理齐十二页顺序，并用麻绳穿孔锁牢。汉克核对无误，夸你比报馆校对员眼力还准。<span class="green">乱作一团的清样在数息间理顺装册。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_3_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 550>><</if>>
	<<englishskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_Courier_3 to ($mpJobReg_Courier_3 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	油墨未干，你翻动太急把第三页与第五页蹭花了字迹，汉克只得挑出来重打校样。<span class="red">满手黑墨，耽搁了半刻钟。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[按文脉排页码 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "按文脉排页码">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link "拿长竿挑落稿页 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc3">>
你从代办亭门后取出挂灯用的长竹竿，把棚顶的几页清样轻轻拨落下来，和汉克一起收进油布袋。<span class="teal">虽慢了片刻，清样总算收齐了。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_3_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 300>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job Courier Encounter 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCourierEncounter to 1>>
你背着一只密封扁木匣走进多瑙河街侧巷，委托单上只写着「雾角里弄自东向西第四盏煤气灯下的侧门」。可市政工昨日刚翻修过路面，拆走了其中一盏旧灯柱，整排侧门又长得一模一样，敲错门便会被当成可疑人物轰走。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-courier-enc4">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 230 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<link "量灯距推门牌 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc4">>
<<if ($maths or 0) gte 260 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你按每两盏煤气灯十二步的固定间距丈量青石板，很快就找见被新砖填平的第三处旧灯座，顺势算准原本的第四盏灯位。轻叩三下侧门后，门内管家核对暗记收下木匣，递出一份厚实的保密脚力钱。<span class="green">凭着旧灯座间距一举锁定了正确门户。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_4_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 760>><</if>>
	<<skulduggery 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	新铺的石板步幅不一，你数偏了一扇门，敲开门后被看门人凶巴巴地盘问了半晌才脱身。<span class="red">白白受了一肚子气。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[量灯距推门牌 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "量灯距推门牌">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "算术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpanimalicon>><<if ($mpJobStableCount or 0) gte 6>><<link "问马厩送炭车 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc4">>
你瞧见巷尾停着河湾马厩送壁炉木炭的板车，上前跟熟识的车夫一打听，车夫指了指门楣刻着旧马蹄印的那扇绿漆门，说那就是老四号灯位。你顺当交完匣子，还搭了半程顺风车回街口。<span class="green">马厩车夫的熟门熟路帮你省去了摸索。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_4_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 660>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">问马厩送炭车 (0:05)（马厩还没这份交情）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<if ($english or 0) gte 210 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 210>><<link "向扫街工问路 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc4">>
<<if ($english or 0) gte 240 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你客气地向巷口歇脚的老扫街工递了半块糖，打听昨天拆灯柱的位置。老工人笑着一指青藤墙下那扇侧门，你顺利交完急件领到赏钱。<span class="green">三言两语便问清了拆灯前的门位。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_4_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 520>><</if>>
	<<englishskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	老工人耳朵背，指错了隔壁的空宅，你在巷子里多绕了两圈才找对地方。<span class="red">小腿跑得发酸。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[向扫街工问路 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "向扫街工问路">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "英语等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 魅力等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link "摇邮铃候接应 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc4">>
你在第三与第五盏灯之间站定，摇响代办亭专用的双音铜铃。不一会儿，其中一扇侧门开了一道缝将木匣接走。<span class="teal">稳妥用邮铃引出了收件管家。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_4_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 300>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job Courier Encounter 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "town">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobCourierEncounter to 1>>
你拐进狼街送最后一份商行汇票时，一只挣脱了铁链的斑点护院猎犬正横在窄巷正中低吼，脚边还拖着半截断锁链。收件的商行掌柜站在二楼铁栏阳台上干着急，不敢下楼开门。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-courier-enc5">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpanimalicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<link "吹低哨抚猎犬 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc5">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 260 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你放缓呼吸蹲下身，吹出训犬人收队时的双音低哨。斑点猎犬耳朵一抖，紧绷的脊背渐渐放松，竟主动凑过来嗅了嗅你的手背。你顺势把断链扣回门旁铁环，二楼掌柜又惊又喜，下楼重赏了你的胆识。<span class="green">烈性护院犬在你手下服服帖帖。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_5_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 680>><</if>>
	<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	哨音吹高了半调，猎犬警惕地狂吠两声扑上前来，你急忙退后攀上石墙才没被咬破裤脚。<span class="red">心脏怦怦直跳，费了好大劲才脱身。</span><<stress 4>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[吹低哨抚猎犬 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "吹低哨抚猎犬">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<if ($mpJobBakeryCount or 0) gte 6>><<link "抛咸饼引开犬 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc5">>
你摸出早班在石炉面包房揣下的两块咸肉桂脆饼边角，远远抛进巷尾的空木桶里。猎犬鼻子一耸，立刻追着肉桂咸香钻进桶边啃食，你趁机快步上前把汇票塞进一楼信箱，掌柜从二楼抛下一袋赏钱。<span class="green">面包房的咸饼边角轻松化解了恶犬拦路。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_5_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 580>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">抛咸饼引开犬 (0:04)（尚未常去面包房当班）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link "结绳吊上阳台 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-courier-enc5">>
你不进窄巷，而是退到斜对面的石阶高处，让二楼掌柜垂下一根麻绳，把装汇票的防水皮夹稳稳系在绳端吊上阳台签收。<span class="teal">不用靠近猎犬便稳妥交了汇票。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_courier_enc_5_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 310>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job Courier]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

/* ==================== 丰收酒馆后厨当班插曲 1–5 ==================== */

:: MP Job PubKitchen Encounter [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobPubKitchenEncounter to 1>>
酒馆后厨的传菜口外，水手长布兰德用指节敲着铜铃催那盘招牌炸鱼排，说整船伙计都在等他这一桌。你掀开刚送来的碎冰筐，最上层那条银鳕的鳃色已经发暗，指尖一按还留着浅坑；前厅又传来酒碗碰撞的喧哗声，巡夜人麦考伊也正坐在吧台边等宵夜。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-pubkitchen-enc">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<link "剔取脊肉复炸 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 260 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你把发暗的腹肉整片剔下，只留脊背最紧实的两条雪白柳肉，裹上冰啤酒面糊二次高温复炸，又在盘边配了一勺现磨黑胡椒与柠檬角。水手长布兰德咬开酥壳，见里层雪白起丝，痛快地把招牌菜分红拍在你手边。<span class="green">催得最急的一桌先上了头等炸鱼排。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 720>><</if>>
	<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_PubKitchen_1 to ($mpJobReg_PubKitchen_1 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	复炸的油温没稳住，外层焦了，里层却还夹生。布兰德把盘子推回来催你重做，锅里的热油溅了你一手。<span class="red">招牌菜的出菜钟点又往后拖了。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[剔取脊肉复炸 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "剔取脊肉复炸">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpfishicon>><<if ($mpJobFishLevel or 0) gte 2>><<link "取鱼档私留鳕 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc">>
你认得冰筐底层系着红麻绳的暗格——那是你在海礁鱼档当班时特意嘱咐老鱼贩留给酒馆的头水活杀银鳕。你抽出底层雪白鲜嫩的鱼柳下锅，炸出的鱼排鲜香扑鼻，布兰德与麦考伊都赞不绝口。<span class="green">鱼档预留的头水银鳕撑起了后厨招牌。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 680>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_PubKitchen_1 to ($mpJobReg_PubKitchen_1 or 0) + 1>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">取鱼档私留鳕 (0:05)（鱼档还没这份交情）</span><</if>>
<br>
<<mpherbicon>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 210>><<link "粗盐柠檬退腥 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc">>
<<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你把整筐银鳕逐条翻检，挑出鳃色透红、按下去能回弹的几条另放一盆，又用粗海盐和柠檬皮把腥气搓净。送鱼小贩没话可说，按降级价退了差额，胖厨长把省下的采买钱折成赏钱分给你。<span class="green">这一筐最后只留下能上台面的好鱼。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 500>><</if>>
	<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	你以为把发暗的鱼皮削掉就能蒙混过去，胖厨长拈起一片闻了闻，当场把整筐退回去，你只能蹲下身收拾淌了一地的冰水。<span class="red">招牌炸鱼排只好改用腌鱼顶数。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[粗盐柠檬退腥 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "粗盐柠檬退腥">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<link "端麦酒稳酒客 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc">>
你先端了一扎刚打出的黑麦酒送去前厅，请布兰德和船员们先润嗓子，后厨的炸鱼排晚了半刻上桌，众人喝高了也没再计较。<span class="teal">这一晚平顺度过，没闹出乱子。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_1_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 300>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job PubKitchen Encounter 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobPubKitchenEncounter to 1>>
夜里海风转急，一阵猛烈的北风顺着后厨砖砌烟囱倒灌下来，防风铁帽被吹歪卡死。滚滚浓烟混着柴灰从灶口反扑出来，呛得学徒直淌眼泪；主灶上那口给巡夜人麦考伊和晚班船员炖了三个时辰的黑啤牛肉大锅眼看就要串烟糊底。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-pubkitchen-enc2">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 250 or ($science or 0) gte 240>><<link "拨正烟道风帽 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc2">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 270 or ($science or 0) gte 260 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你用湿布掩住口鼻，踩上后墙检修铁梯拉开副排烟活门，用长铁钩顺着风向一拨，卡死的旋转风帽咔哒一声转回背风面。屋里的浓烟瞬时被抽吸一空，黑啤炖牛肉保住了醇厚焦香，麦考伊多留了两枚银币赏你的机敏。<span class="green">烟道重归通畅，整锅浓汤丝毫未串烟味。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_2_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 780>><</if>>
	<<athletics 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_PubKitchen_2 to ($mpJobReg_PubKitchen_2 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	铁钩在油腻的烟管内壁滑脱，震落了一捧黑灰，你呛得连声咳嗽，等胖厨长拿湿麻袋封住灶门时，汤面已沾了一层灰星。<span class="red">脸颊抹了两道黑灰，没能拿到赏钱。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[拨正烟道风帽 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "拨正烟道风帽">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span> 或 科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 220>><<link "撤柴盖布余焖 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc2">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你当机立断用铁铲撤去生烟的湿柴，只留底层无烟红炭，再用浸了黑麦酒的干净麻布严严实实封住锅沿闷烧。倒灌的烟气半丝没进锅里，牛肉反而焖得酥烂入味，麦考伊喝得碗底朝天。<span class="green">急智撤柴封锅，保住了整锅招牌炖肉。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_2_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 560>><</if>>
	<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_PubKitchen_2 to ($mpJobReg_PubKitchen_2 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	锅盖封慢了一步，表层肉汤还是染了一丝苦烟味，你只得撇去上层浮汤重新兑酒。<span class="red">忙活了半天，汤量少了一成。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[撤柴盖布余焖 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "撤柴盖布余焖">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link "抬锅移去副灶 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc2">>
你招呼学徒一起用粗木杠穿起大铁锅双耳，咬牙把滚烫的炖锅抬到靠近后门通风处的炭盆上慢温，再打开后窗放烟。<span class="teal">笨力气保住了炖肉，顺当送出了宵夜。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_2_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 320>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job PubKitchen Encounter 3 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobPubKitchenEncounter to 1>>
修船厂的船木匠老乔里今晚做东，包下长桌请全班木工学徒吃席，点了整整六扇蜂蜜烟熏猪肋排。可后院柴棚昨夜漏雨，备用的橡木炭受了潮，焖炉温度死活升不上来，肋排表面的蜜汁只冒白泡不结脆壳。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-pubkitchen-enc3">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>><<link "淋烈朗姆炙烤 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc3">>
<<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 270 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你取来吧台高度数的陈年朗姆酒，混入迷迭香与槐花蜜刷满肋排，在出炉前引燃酒气。蓝色火苗贴着肉面一卷而过，瞬间锁住肉汁并烧出焦红诱人的脆壳。老乔里带着徒弟们轰然叫好，拍下一叠厚赏。<span class="green">烈酒炙烤出的脆皮肋排香气震翻了满堂酒客。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_3_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 820>><</if>>
	<<housekeeping 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_PubKitchen_3 to ($mpJobReg_PubKitchen_3 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	朗姆酒淋得稍多，火苗蹿高燎焦了两根肋骨尖，你急忙盖锅灭火，手背被烘得发烫。<span class="red">卖相欠了些火候，没能拿到老乔里的红封。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[淋烈朗姆炙烤 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "淋烈朗姆炙烤">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "家政等级：<span class='purple'>D+</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpsmithicon>><<if ($physique or 0) gte 7600 or ($tending or 0) gte 230>><<link "劈干松木催火 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc3">>
<<if ($physique or 0) gte 8200 or ($tending or 0) gte 260 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你拎起手斧把干燥的旧橡木酒桶板劈成细条，架空垫在潮炭底下猛拉风箱。底火呼地烧透整炉红炭，六扇肋排滋滋冒油准点出炉，老乔里夸你劈柴引火的手劲不输船厂壮工。<span class="green">炉温应声而起，六扇肋排烤得恰到好处。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_3_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 660>><</if>>
	<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_PubKitchen_3 to ($mpJobReg_PubKitchen_3 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	风箱拉得太急，炭灰飞进烤盘，你只好把肋排端出来重新刷酱。<span class="red">胳膊拉得酸麻，晚了一刻才上桌。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[劈干松木催火 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "劈干松木催火">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "体魄：7600 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link "切排改上铁板 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc3">>
你将整扇肋排顺着骨缝切开，平铺在滚烫的铸铁煎板上分段煎熟，再浇上热蜜汁装盘。老乔里和徒弟们吃得痛快，也没挑剔不是整扇出炉。<span class="teal">改上铁板按时供上了大席。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_3_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 330>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job PubKitchen Encounter 4 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobPubKitchenEncounter to 1>>
晚市最热闹的时候，地窖楼梯口忽然传来砰的一声闷响——新开封的那桶陈年黑麦啤酒因发酵气太足，铜龙头的木塞圈裂开一道缝，带着白沫的麦酒正往石阶上狂喷。船木匠老乔里恰巧在吧台外喝酒，水手长布兰德还在催第二轮酒。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-pubkitchen-enc4">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<if ($physique or 0) gte 7800 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 240>><<link "削木楔硬顶塞口 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc4">>
<<if ($physique or 0) gte 8400 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 270 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你顺手削尖一截硬橡木塞，裹上干净麻布，迎着喷涌的酒柱一槌将铜龙头连同新木楔死死砸回桶孔。麦酒滴水不漏，你顺势接满四大扎黑啤端上前厅，胖厨长把省下的半桶酒钱分了你一大份。<span class="green">一槌止住喷涌的酒柱，保住了整桶佳酿。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_4_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 860>><</if>>
	<<skulduggery 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_PubKitchen_1 to ($mpJobReg_PubKitchen_1 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	酒气冲力太大，木楔滑了一下，冰凉的麦酒喷了你满头满脸，等塞住时已经流掉了小半桶。<span class="red">浑身麦酒味，还得拿拖把清地窖。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[削木楔硬顶塞口 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "削木楔硬顶塞口">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "体魄：7800 或 诡术等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link "请老乔里箍桶 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc4">>
你赶紧朝前厅喊了一声船木匠老乔里。老乔里拎起随身的木工锤跨进地窖，三两下便把松脱的铁桶箍敲紧归位，换上新木塞。你端上两扎满沫的黑啤谢他，胖厨长也笑着给你记了功。<span class="green">熟客老木匠出手，三锤便锁死了漏桶。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_4_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 580>><</if>>
<<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_PubKitchen_3 to ($mpJobReg_PubKitchen_3 or 0) + 1>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpdrinkicon>><<link "拿大铜盆接酒 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc4">>
你抱来两只干净的大铜盆垫在龙头底下接住涌出的麦酒，一盆供前厅现打现喝，另一盆留给后厨炖牛肉做卤汁，半滴也没白流进排水沟。<span class="teal">接出来的散酒全派上了用场。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_4_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 340>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
</div>

:: MP Job PubKitchen Encounter 5 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "pub">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $daily.mpJobPubKitchenEncounter to 1>>
近海渔船的水手刚把两竹篓深海活青蟹卸在后门，绑篓口的湿水草绳突然崩断，十几只碗口大的青蟹举着大螯爬满后厨石地，有两只还往传菜口外乱窜。
<br><br>
<div id="mp-job-pubkitchen-enc5">
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpfishicon>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 230 or ($tending or 0) gte 230>><<link "麻绳快手捆螯 (0:06)">><<pass 6>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc5">>
<<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 260 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你手疾眼快地从蟹背正后方按住甲壳，左手压住双螯，右手麻绳绕三圈一扯便捆得结结实实。不过一刻钟，十几只大青蟹全被捆成一串码进蒸笼，水手长布兰德当场包下第一笼下酒，赏了你一把银币。<span class="green">十几只活蟹一只没跑，全上了蒸笼。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_5_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 680>><</if>>
	<<tending 1>><<stress -2>><<lstress>><<set $mpJobReg_PubKitchen_1 to ($mpJobReg_PubKitchen_1 or 0) + 1>>
<<else>>
	一只青蟹猛地回钳夹住你的围裙角，连带着撞翻了水瓢，你费了九牛二虎之力才把它们赶回篓里。<span class="red">指节被蟹壳刮红了一块。</span><<pain 2>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[麻绳快手捆螯 (0:06)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "麻绳快手捆螯">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "运动等级：<span class='purple'>D</span> 或 照料等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 6>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<if ($science or 0) gte 210>><<link "泼冰水令收爪 (0:05)">><<pass 5>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc5">>
<<if ($science or 0) gte 240 or random(1, 3) gte 2>>
	你舀起冰桶里的碎冰盐水迎头泼去，海蟹受寒立刻缩起步足与大螯不再乱窜。你用长铁钳一只只夹进深木桶盖好，胖厨长笑着夸你省力又聪明。<span class="green">一瓢冰盐水便治服了满地活蟹。</span>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_5_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 520>><</if>>
	<<scienceskill 1 "no_star">><<stress -2>><<lstress>>
<<else>>
	水泼得太散，石地变得湿滑难走，你蹲在地上追了半晌才算捡齐。<span class="red">裤脚湿了半截。</span><<stress 2>><<tiredness 2>><<gstress>>
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>><<else>><<link [[泼冰水令收爪 (0:05)|MP Insufficient]]>><<set $mpInsuffRet to (State.passage)>><<set $mpInsuffLabel to "泼冰水令收爪">><<set $mpInsuffReq to "科学等级：<span class='purple'>D</span>">><<pass 5>><</link>><</if>>
<br>
<<mpcarryicon>><<link "木铲扣筐拦回 (0:04)">><<pass 4>><<replace "#mp-job-pubkitchen-enc5">>
你先关死通往前厅的摆门，用大木铲把乱爬的青蟹一只只拨进深底铁锅里，压上沉重的木锅盖。<span class="teal">没让一只螃蟹爬进前厅惊扰酒客。</span>
<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("job_pubkitchen_enc_5_d" + ((window.Time && Time.days) or 0))>><<money 300>><</if>>
<<stress -1>><<lstress>>
<br><br>
<<link [[返回岗位 (0:02)|MP Job PubKitchen]]>><<pass 2>><<mpalertclear>><</link>>

<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
